1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:01,260
When I was eight,

2
00:00:01,310 --> 00:00:03,248
I knew vampires were real.

3
00:00:03,298 --> 00:00:03,998
Every night,

4
00:00:04,048 --> 00:00:06,680
Gran poured rice along my windowsill.

5
00:00:06,730 --> 00:00:07,975
They can't help themselves,

6
00:00:08,025 --> 00:00:08,895
she'd whisper.

7
00:00:08,945 --> 00:00:11,032
They must count every grain.

8
00:00:11,082 --> 00:00:11,952
And by then...

9
00:00:12,002 --> 00:00:13,269
the sun is up.

10
00:00:13,499 --> 00:00:14,834
I'm thirty-four now.

11
00:00:14,884 --> 00:00:16,079
Gran's gone.

12
00:00:16,129 --> 00:00:17,849
I moved into her house.

13
00:00:17,899 --> 00:00:20,024
She'd covered every mirror in it.

14
00:00:20,094 --> 00:00:21,449
Vampires aren't real.

15
00:00:21,499 --> 00:00:22,404
So tonight,

16
00:00:22,454 --> 00:00:24,269
I swept the rice away.

17
00:00:24,739 --> 00:00:25,789
Three a.m.

18
00:00:25,839 --> 00:00:27,301
Something woke me.

19
00:00:27,411 --> 00:00:28,101
A voice.

20
00:00:28,151 --> 00:00:29,065
Counting.

21
00:00:29,115 --> 00:00:30,680
Four hundred and six.

22
00:00:30,730 --> 00:00:32,718
Four hundred and seven.

23
00:00:32,768 --> 00:00:34,809
It wasn't coming from outside.

24
00:00:34,859 --> 00:00:36,245
It was closer.

25
00:00:36,475 --> 00:00:37,640
I was on the floor,

26
00:00:37,690 --> 00:00:40,394
sorting rice into neat little piles.

27
00:00:40,444 --> 00:00:41,309
And the voice...

28
00:00:41,359 --> 00:00:42,422
was mine.

29
00:00:42,812 --> 00:00:45,200
I pulled the cloth off Gran's mirror.

30
00:00:45,350 --> 00:00:46,455
The room was there.

31
00:00:46,505 --> 00:00:48,160
The rice was there.

32
00:00:48,270 --> 00:00:49,356
I wasn't.

33
00:00:49,986 --> 00:00:52,730
The rice was never meant to keep them out.

34
00:00:52,780 --> 00:00:54,575
Gran was keeping me in.

35
00:00:55,045 --> 00:00:56,714
I've finished counting.

36
00:00:56,784 --> 00:00:58,216
It's still dark.

37
00:00:58,326 --> 00:00:59,256
And the window...

38
00:00:59,306 --> 00:01:00,411
is open.

39
00:01:01,121 --> 00:01:02,313
One.
